---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---
<section class="panel hero" aria-label="總覽">
  <span class="plate">MONITOR ROOM</span>
  <div class="panel-body">
    <p class="orient">聲音 × 智能應用 · 作品即訊號</p>
    <h1>把聲學的理解門檻,<br />調到<em>人人可聽見</em>。</h1>
    <div class="readouts">
      <span>FOCUS <b>心理聲學 × 人機協作</b></span>
      <span>ROUTE <b>作品 → 證據 → 研究</b></span>
      <span>OUT <b>混合多聲道監聽</b></span>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <button class="cta" data-power data-scroll="1">▶ 開機試聽</button>
      <a class="cta--ghost" href={`${base}/research/`}>研究方向 →</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-hint mono">這個站是一台可演奏的監聽台:開機後,每一軌都能發聲、能推、能玩。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="ticks" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</section>
